token\">--duration-base</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"fill duration value\">250 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"fill target value description\">circle 0 → 150% at the pocket's centre</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3\" data-name=\"rank seal timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"rank seal step label\">Rank seal</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"rank seal easing token\">--ease-squish</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"rank seal duration cell\"><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"rank seal duration token\">--duration-quick</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"rank seal duration value\">160 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-3-4\" data-name=\"rank seal target value description\">scale 0.62 → 1</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4\" data-name=\"numeral timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"numeral step label\">Numeral</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"numeral easing token\">--ease-arrive</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-3\" data-name=\"numeral duration cell\"><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"numeral duration token\">--duration-quick</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"numeral duration value\">160 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-4-4\" data-name=\"numeral target value description\">opacity 0 → 1, scale 0.4 → 1, delay 100 ms</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5\" data-name=\"part pose timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-1\" data-name=\"part pose step label\">Part pose</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-2\" data-name=\"part pose easing token\">--ease-glide</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-3\" data-name=\"part pose duration cell\"><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"part pose duration token\">--duration-base</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"part pose duration value\">250 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-5-4\" data-name=\"part pose target value description\">each device's own travel</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6\" data-name=\"release timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-1\" data-name=\"release step label\">Release</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-2\" data-name=\"release easing token\">--ease-depart</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-3\" data-name=\"release duration cell\"><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-3-1\" data-name=\"release duration token\">--duration-quick</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-3-2\" data-name=\"release duration value\">160 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-6-4\" data-name=\"release target value description\">circle back to 0, numeral withdrawn</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7\" data-name=\"hover timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-1\" data-name=\"hover step label\">Hover</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-2\" data-name=\"hover easing token\">--ease-linear</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-3\" data-name=\"hover duration cell\"><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-3-1\" data-name=\"hover duration token\">--duration-tick</span><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-3-2\" data-name=\"hover duration value\">100 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-7-4\" data-name=\"hover target value description\">surface and line colour</span></div>\n<div class=\"trow\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8\" data-name=\"steam loop timing row\"><span class=\"tstep\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8-1\" data-name=\"steam loop step label\">Steam loop</span><span class=\"ttok\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8-2\" data-name=\"steam loop easing token\">keyframe sequence</span><span class=\"tdur\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8-3\" data-name=\"steam loop duration cell\"><span class=\"tnum\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8-3-1\" data-name=\"steam loop duration value\">1500 ms</span></span><span class=\"tval\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2-8-4\" data-name=\"steam loop target value description\">rise and fade, per-device offset</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>",
